# Non-secret scanservjs settings. Read raw by podman (quotes stay as written), so the value below reaches the image's
# entrypoint unchanged; the entrypoint (v3.3.0 entrypoint.sh:26-31) inserts it under [devices] in /etc/sane.d/airscan.conf, which is
# sane-airscan's own `"name" = "url"` syntax. IP, not hostname: the printer refuses POST /eSCL/ScanJobs (403) unless the Host header
# is its IP (GETs work with any Host). Keep the DHCP reservation for the printer (README.md).
# SCANIMAGE_LIST_IGNORE is deliberately NOT set: it would disable `scanimage -L` and the UI would list no device (config.js:268).
AIRSCAN_DEVICES="HP Smart Tank 580" = "http://10.0.0.34:8080/eSCL"
